window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>From the pens of four <i>USA Today</i> best-selling authors, a brand-new Witches of Port Townsend....</p> <p>Four identical sisters are prophesied to hold the fate of the entire world in their powerful hands. Meet: Moria, Claire, Aerin, and Tierra - and then hold on to your seat, because they're going to take you on a wild, wild ride. </p> <p>Listen to the Witches of Port Townsend in order:</p> <p></p> <ol> <li><i>Book 1: Which Witch Is Which?</i></li> <li><i>Book 2: Which Witch Is Wicked?</i></li> <li><i>Book 3: Which Witch Is Wild?</i></li> <li><i>Book 4: Which Witch Is Willing?</i></li> </ol>"; 
